/Alt (Flowchart shows the workflow used to identify potential therapeutic targets for gastric cancer. It begins with a GEO search giving 31 datasets, followed by two branches: branch one used preprocessing, normalization, DEG analysis, and RRA with Bonferroni, giving 254 genes. Branch two used 19 datasets for WGCNA analysis and grouped hub genes into high, medium, and exploratory. Overlap produced 236 genes. PPI network analysis and enrichment analyses gave 29 genes. Validation of DE, survival analysis, and literature search gave 4 targets. TCMBank compounds were then used for ADMET profiling, docking, and interaction analysis with these targets.)
/K [1554 0 R 1555 0 R 1556 0 R 1557 0 R 1558 0 R 1559 0 R 1560 0 R]
/P 41 0 R
/S /Figure
/T <FEFF004600690067007500720065>
/Type /StructElem
